<title>UK: British Building sees selling co at 75p/shr.</title>
<headline>British Building sees selling co at 75p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Building and Engineering Appliances Plc said on Wednesday it expected to agree in the near future to a cash offer from Britannia Group Plc for 75p per share.  </p>
<p>British Building's shares jumped nearly 30 percent, rising 15.5p to 70.5, while Britannia Group stayed unchanged at 30p by 1125 GMT.</p>
<p>In March, British Building said it had received an approach from construction group and property developer Britannia, but it gave no further details at the time. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
